  "prefLabel": "Agr 1905.01 Biosecurity",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 1905.01 Biosecurity. A written plan for disease control and prevention, including cleaning and disinfection of premises and conveyances, shall be on file with the department, in hard copy or electronically prior to initial licensing or license renewal and shall be re-submitted upon any change in program content.\n\nSource. #12555, eff 6-21-18",
